Definitions
3. In this Schedule —
“BC” means a standard or specification issued by the Building and Construction Authority;
“BS” is the abbreviation for British Standard, which means a standard or specification issued by the British Standards Institution;
“BS EN” is the abbreviation for British Standard European Norm, which means a standard or specification issued by the British Standards Institution;
“SS” is the abbreviation for Singapore Standard;
“SS EN” is the abbreviation for Singapore Standard European Norm, which means a standard or specification issued by the Enterprise Singapore Board, established under section 3 of the Enterprise Singapore Board Act 2018.
